{
    "title": "Weather Forecast, Live Weather",
    "description": "Local Weather Forecast application helps you to update the weather anywhere accurately and quickly. Weather data is provided hourly and updated daily. The weather forecast in the coming days is a favorable condition for you to arrange your plans.\r\n\r\nWeather forecast is an application that is fully updated with weather information, temperature, humidity as well as suggestions for future activities.\r\n\r\n<b>Main Feature:</b>\r\n\u2600\ufe0f Easy and friendly interface:\r\nThe application interface is updated according to the weather condition to help you have a friendly look when using the application. The application is also very simple and easy to use, keeping track of the weather indicators clearly. Automatically change the wallpaper according to the current weather condition\r\n\r\n\u2600\ufe0f Full live weather forecast today:\r\nWeather forecast indicators are updated in real time hourly, daily. Indicators include temperature, wind direction, wind speed, air quality, visibility. In addition, the application also supports sunrise and sunset indicators, outdoor sports indicators.\r\n\r\n\u2600\ufe0f 24 hour weather forecast:\r\nThis is an important and essential feature for a weather forecast application. It gives you an overview of the weather for the next 24 hours. You can watch at any time for the weather forecast for the next few hours.\r\n\r\n\u2600\ufe0f Weather forecast for the next 7 days:\r\nYou are planning for the next few days, this is a feature that helps you forecast the weather in advance for your plan. Long-term planning, having fun is easy using the Weather Forecast application.\r\n\r\n\u2600\ufe0f Manage current location:\r\nYou can manage the location you want to monitor the weather easily. Anywhere you want to track. You just need to enter the name of the place and you can easily know the current weather, 24h, the next 7 days in that area.\r\n\r\n\u2600\ufe0f Weather radar map:\r\nThe radar map display feature helps you see the weather in general on the map. Moreover, the radar map will show the rain, wind direction, as well as the most general weather. Bring you interesting experiences.\r\n\r\n\u2600\ufe0f Air Quality Index & UVI:\r\nYou can monitor air indexes such as: PM10, PM2.5, CO, NO2, SO2, O3, quality level.\r\n\r\nIt's a simple, intuitive weather forecast app that makes it easy for you to keep up-to-date with hourly, daily weather readings. The information on reliable local weather forecast. Indicators of temperature, precipitation, wind direction, air index are clear and easy to follow. You'll plan your plans with confidence with a local weather forecast app. \r\n\r\nOur Weather App may request your Location data for a functional purpose. We may use different technologies to determine location, such as GPS, Wi-Fi, or other network-based data such as IP address. Your GPS geolocation cannot be accessed without your consent. We DO NOT provide your Location data to ad networks and third parties.\r\n\r\nPlease contribute and leave 5 stars if you love our local weather forecast app. Your comments help us to improve the application further.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Local Weather Forecast application helps you to update the weather anywhere accurately and quickly. Weather data is provided hourly and updated daily. The weather forecast in the coming days is a favorable condition for you to arrange your plans.<br><br>Weather forecast is an application that is fully updated with weather information, temperature, humidity as well as suggestions for future activities.<br><br><b>Main Feature:</b><br>\u2600\ufe0f Easy and friendly interface:<br>The application interface is updated according to the weather condition to help you have a friendly look when using the application. The application is also very simple and easy to use, keeping track of the weather indicators clearly. Automatically change the wallpaper according to the current weather condition<br><br>\u2600\ufe0f Full live weather forecast today:<br>Weather forecast indicators are updated in real time hourly, daily. Indicators include temperature, wind direction, wind speed, air quality, visibility. In addition, the application also supports sunrise and sunset indicators, outdoor sports indicators.<br><br>\u2600\ufe0f 24 hour weather forecast:<br>This is an important and essential feature for a weather forecast application. It gives you an overview of the weather for the next 24 hours. You can watch at any time for the weather forecast for the next few hours.<br><br>\u2600\ufe0f Weather forecast for the next 7 days:<br>You are planning for the next few days, this is a feature that helps you forecast the weather in advance for your plan. Long-term planning, having fun is easy using the Weather Forecast application.<br><br>\u2600\ufe0f Manage current location:<br>You can manage the location you want to monitor the weather easily. Anywhere you want to track. You just need to enter the name of the place and you can easily know the current weather, 24h, the next 7 days in that area.<br><br>\u2600\ufe0f Weather radar map:<br>The radar map display feature helps you see the weather in general on the map. Moreover, the radar map will show the rain, wind direction, as well as the most general weather. Bring you interesting experiences.<br><br>\u2600\ufe0f Air Quality Index &amp; UVI:<br>You can monitor air indexes such as: PM10, PM2.5, CO, NO2, SO2, O3, quality level.<br><br>It&#39;s a simple, intuitive weather forecast app that makes it easy for you to keep up-to-date with hourly, daily weather readings. The information on reliable local weather forecast. Indicators of temperature, precipitation, wind direction, air index are clear and easy to follow. You&#39;ll plan your plans with confidence with a local weather forecast app. <br><br>Our Weather App may request your Location data for a functional purpose. We may use different technologies to determine location, such as GPS, Wi-Fi, or other network-based data such as IP address. Your GPS geolocation cannot be accessed without your consent. We DO NOT provide your Location data to ad networks and third parties.<br><br>Please contribute and leave 5 stars if you love our local weather forecast app. Your comments help us to improve the application further.",
